<item><title>Cameroon cancels CFA36.7 billion fuel tender for four power plants</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-cancels-cfa36-7-billion-fuel-tender-for-four-power-c19862/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-cancels-cfa36-7-billion-fuel-tender-for-four-power-c19862/</guid><category>Cameroon</category><description>The state electricity company SOCADEL scrapped the contract for heavy fuel oil, saying delivery and storage terms need to be revised.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:50:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-cancels-cfa36-7-billion-fuel-tender-for-four-power-c19862/share.jpg" length="43296" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-cancels-cfa36-7-billion-fuel-tender-for-four-power-c19862/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Cameroon opens first international auto and transport expo in Douala</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-opens-first-international-auto-and-transport-expo-1e4a05/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cm/cameroon-opens-first-international-auto-and-transport-expo-1e4a05/</guid><category>Cameroon</category><description>Cameroon Auto Expo 2026 runs in Douala until November 15, bringing carmakers, transport operators and public institutions together for business meetings.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:16:31 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" length="34085" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cm.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
